Package: cdmeta
Title: Confidence-Distribution-Based Inference for Random-Effects Meta-Analysis
Version: 1.1-1
Date: 2026-08-19
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports: pimeta (>= 1.1.3)
Suggests: metafor
